        "name": "Almaty Panfilov Park, Zenkov Cathedral and Green Bazaar",
        "description": "Soviet-era parks, a wooden cathedral and the colourful Green Bazaar market.",
        "details": "Almaty sits beneath the Tian Shan range. Panfilov Park holds the Zenkov Cathedral, an all-wood Orthodox church built without nails, and a war memorial. The Green Bazaar sells dried fruit, horse sausage and Kazakh sweets. The Kok Tobe hill has a cable car and a view.",
