        "description": "A high-altitude skating rink and a ski resort with a gondola to mountain views.",
        "details": "Medeu is the world highest skating rink, in a valley above Almaty. A cable car continues to Shymbulak, a ski resort that is lively in winter and a hiking base in summer. The Big Almaty Lake further up changes colour with the season and is a half-day trip.",
