        "name": "Big Almaty Lake",
        "description": "A turquoise alpine lake at 2,500 metres in the mountains above Almaty.",
        "details": "The lake sits in a restricted zone, so entrance is via a checkpoint. The road is steep, and the best light is in the morning. It is the easiest half-day outing from Almaty. Bring a jacket, as it is cooler at altitude.",
